{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18205020","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18205020","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1820502001:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1820502002:0":{"text":"???","source_cn":"……？<key:dialog6>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC29F8833C93C788","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1820502003:0":{"text":"... Isn't this nice? Feels just like the good old days when we used to hang out together.","source_cn":"……说，说起来，现在的情景像不像我们小时候？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39DEB500CF06B2F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1820502004:0":{"text":"Whenever the weather was fine, we'd sit around a bonfire, gaze at the stars, and chat the night away.","source_cn":"每逢天气晴朗的夜晚，我们就会像现在这样围坐在篝火旁，一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4ED06284ACE61DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1820502005:0":{"text":"W-We did?","source_cn":"是……是这样吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC59D76394007A2A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1820502006:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1820502007:0":{"text":"Yeah, but after you joined the army, we hardly got to spend time together.","source_cn":"嗯，平时你总是忙于训练。正式参军后，这样的机会就更少了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C5CFB989425EE73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1820502008:0":{"text":"You used to invite Thane over every year during the holidays. You two would take me hunting with you, even though I was just a little girl.","source_cn":"对了，你每年都会邀请瑟恩来家里做客！如果赶上晨辉节或是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55F40103DD321A3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1820502009:0":{"text":"You'd show me how to hunt with a bow and dagger, while Thane taught me swordsmanship and how to stay hidden.","source_cn":"你教我使用弓箭和匕首，怎样去追踪猎物；瑟恩则教我使用短...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6E9D080A546E713","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1820502010:0":{"text":"... Was I really that good? Nowadays, all I do is help Baba Muriel with the grunt work around the clinic.","source_cn":"我有这么厉害吗……？我只管帮穆婆婆做些力气活，从没用过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FB21B44D93F7919","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1820502011:0":{"text":"I don't know the first thing about weapons.","source_cn":"话说回来，我现在也不会用什么武器。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CE79C0F0A16D9F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1820502012:0":{"text":"But you seemed to have no problem fending off that Graveborn assassin—","source_cn":"可是你不是跟那个亡灵刺客——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CF450618BF48053","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1820502013:1":{"text":"You were the greatest swordsman I'd ever known. Before meeting you, I'd never lost a single duel.","source_cn":"你很强，是最顶尖的剑客。在遇见你之前，沉溺于剑术决斗的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA91F0A576A2153C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1820502014:0":{"text":"Even after years of training and fighting side by side, the best I could manage against you was a draw.","source_cn":"我们一起受训，一起杀敌。这么多年来，我还是只能和你打成平手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9274A41BCDB42CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1820502015:0":{"text":"Can anyone back up what you're saying?","source_cn":"可谁能证明你说的就是事实啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71847E92EC19D5AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1820502016:0":{"text":"... Everyone else who saw you in action was killed by the Bantus Graveborn long ago.","source_cn":"……能证明的人早已战死。他们皆死于班题斯亡灵之手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35375960AE356063","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1820502017:0":{"text":"You and I are the only survivors from our squad.","source_cn":"我和你，是同期队伍里唯二的幸存者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BD72B692565C6F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1820502018:0":{"text":"Oh... sorry.","source_cn":"呃……抱歉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB91467D458EE0868","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1820502019:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:22:1820502019":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1820502020:0":{"text":"Rain, come and give me a hand.","source_cn":"里纳，过来给老身搭把手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC239CF1DD0302AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1820502021:0":{"text":"Coming, Baba!","source_cn":"哦！来了，婆婆！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E652470844B4668","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1820502022:0":{"text":"I'll handle the patrol. You two get some rest.","source_cn":"我去巡逻，你们两个抓紧时间休息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0563A8E7831967F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1820502023:0":{"text":"*Sigh*...","source_cn":"……唉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2218B7E3E1E01F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:22:0:1":{"text":"(So awkward...)","source_cn":"（气氛好尴尬……）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF5155ABD3786FEA5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(So awkward...)","female":"(So awkward...)","variant_male_record_index":"93617","variant_female_record_index":"